{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","骑士之心"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，特弥希娅会在战场上冲锋，对路径上的敌人造成伤害；主动释放时，向前跳跃，对周围敌人造成伤害和击倒，并提高自身冲锋的速度。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，特弥希娅不会进行普通攻击，而是会选择一名最远的敌人向其冲锋，撞击路径上的所有敌人，造成125% + 10% ATK伤害，在抵达目标位置后掉转方向并回复180点能量。攻击速度和急速不会影响特弥希娅的动作速度，每1点攻击速度或急速使得自身冲锋伤害提高1%。\n使用终极技能时，战马“晨曦”向前跳跃，对自身1格范围的敌人造成300% ATK伤害并击倒，随后使自身冲锋速度永久提高10%，最多叠加2次。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":47,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":162,"end":170,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","冲锋造成伤害提升至130% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","冲锋造成伤害提升至140% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","冲锋造成伤害提升至150% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","冲锋造成伤害提升至160% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","铁骑飞蹄"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","冲锋掉转方向时，对敌人造成伤害并使其造成伤害降低。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","特弥希娅冲锋掉转方向时，使“晨曦”抬起后蹄对一名敌人踢击，造成150% + 15% ATK伤害和打断效果，并使其造成伤害降低15%，持续5秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","特弥希娅冲锋掉转方向时，还会使自身回复10%的已损失生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至170% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","无畏之剑"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","冲锋时对自身范围的敌人造成基于对方攻击力的伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","特弥希娅冲锋时，挥舞双头大剑对自身1格范围的敌人造成4次对方攻击力40% + 5%伤害，每次伤害最高不超过自身70% + 7%的攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":58,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提升至对方攻击力45% + 5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提升至对方攻击力50% + 5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提升至对方攻击力60% + 5%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击力，首次释放“骑士之心”后进一步提升攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升11%。且当首次释放“骑士之心”后，额外提升2%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升14%。且当首次释放“骑士之心”后，额外提升3%攻击力。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升18%。且当首次释放“骑士之心”后，额外提升4%攻击力。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","势不可当"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","释放终极技能若干次后，自身永久免疫控制效果并且冲锋伤害变为真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","释放“骑士之心”2次后，特弥希娅永久处于霸体状态，并且冲锋的伤害会变为真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","该状态下自身每秒回复1%的最大生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该状态下自身每秒回复1.2%的最大生命值。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","该状态下自身每秒回复1.4%的最大生命值。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“骑士之心”冲锋撞击到的敌人护甲降低。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“骑士之心”冲锋撞击到的敌人护甲永久降低1%，最多叠加6次。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","特弥希娅在冲锋期间受到伤害降低30%，释放“铁骑飞蹄”时，额外对敌方造成其最大生命值30%的伤害，最高不超过自身600% ATK，并使自身获得300% ATK的护盾。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":71,"end":79,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","双星辰光"]]}